    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage, not to the whole image flow.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image is first encoded, then split into windows before the compact thought process starts. The repeated ticks stay inside DQ-CTM, while the encoder and decoder remain outside that loop. The same DQ-CTM parameters are reused across those ticks.",
